WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.750
With the Microsoft Translator extension, you can now translate webpages from 

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.750
over 50 different languages to your language of choice with the simple click of a button 

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.500
making web content from around the world even more accessible to you on Microsoft Edge!

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
First, go to a website written in a Microsoft Translator supported language. 

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.500
For this example we will use MSN Spanish. 

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
As the page loads, you will see the Translator icon show up in the address bar.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Now, click on translate. 

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The webpage will be translated to your language. 

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.750
You can also select some text, right click 

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.500
and select translate in the context menu to get a translation for the selected text.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.750
If you need to change any additional language settings, 

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
you can simply go into "Options" and change your preferences.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Thanks for watching!

